    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG O'DWYER ARE PRIVILEGED TO BRING TO THE MARKET THIS STUNNING DETACHED 5 BEDROOM DORMER BUNGALOW ON 0.42 ACRES JUST OFF THE VIRGINIA/DUBLIN ROAD."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 4.0m x 2.3m\n\n\nSitting Room - 4.5m x 3.9m\n\n\nKitchen - 5.1m x 4.1m\n\n\nUtility Room - 1.6m x 3.0m\n\n\nLiving Room - 4.7m x 3.4m\n\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.6m x 3.4m\n\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - 2.0m x 1.1m\n\n\nWalk in Wardrobe - 2.4m x 1.4m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.9m x 2.9m\n\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.9m x 3.9m\n\n\nBathroom - 2.9m x 2.4m\n\n\nLanding - 4.0m x 3.6m\n\n\nBedroom 4 - 4.0m x 4.0m\n\n\nBedroom 5 - 4.0m x 3.6m\n\n\nShower Room - 2.3m x 2.3m\n\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Nestled in the picturesque countryside in the ouskirts of Virginia, this modern and charming detached dormer bungalow offers a luxurious and inviting living space. Boasting a spacious 192 sq m layout, this second-hand property features 5 bedrooms, 2 reception rooms, and 3 bathrooms, ideal for a growing family seeking comfort and convenience.</li><li> Situated in the townland of Drumheel, close to Maghera cross along the Virginia/Dublin Road, an area characterized by rolling drumlin landscapes and proximity to Lough Ramor.</li><li> Perfectly located along the Cavan/Meath border, only 6.2km from Virginia town and 14.8km from Kells, providing a balance of \"country living\" with quick access to the N3 for commutes toward Kells, Navan, or Dublin.</li><li> Local shops and Carrigabruise primary schools are within close vicinity of the dwelling.</li><li> The well-maintained interior is bright and clean, creating a welcoming atmosphere throughout.</li><li> Outside, the property sits on a generous 0.42-acre plot with a lovely garden and off-street parking, providing ample outdoor space for relaxation and entertainment. With its convenient location and modern amenities, this property offers a perfect blend of rural tranquillity and contemporary living.</li><li> Oil Fired Central Heating</li><li> Group Water Scheme</li><li> Biocycle Sewerage System</li><li> Year of Construction : 2005</li><li> Don't miss the opportunity to make this beautiful house your new home.</ul>"
      },
      {
